<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pricing — Nevarro Technologies</title>
<meta name="description" content="How Nevarro engagements are priced: consultation from USD 150, and custom pricing for partnerships and co-built products.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=EB+Garamond:wght@400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script is:inline>
  (function(){var t=localStorage.getItem('nev-theme');if(t){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);}})();
</script>
<style is:global>
  :root{
    --canvas:#f7f7f4; --surface:#f2f1ed; --raised:#e6e5e0; --border:#dedcd6;
    --text:#26251e; --muted:#7a7974; --faint:#a1a19f; --stone:#cdcdc9;
    --ember:#f54e00; --amber:#c08532;
    --btn-fill:#26251e; --btn-fill-text:#f7f7f4;
    --sans:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    --serif:'EB Garamond',ui-serif,Georgia,serif;
    --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --canvas:#1a1915; --surface:#21201a; --raised:#2a2922; --border:#38372f;
    --text:#f2f1ed; --muted:#a1a19f; --faint:#84847e; --stone:#38372f;
    --ember:#ff6a24; --amber:#d0973f;
    --btn-fill:#e6e5e0; --btn-fill-text:#26251e;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --canvas:#1a1915; --surface:#21201a; --raised:#2a2922; --border:#38372f;
      --text:#f2f1ed; --muted:#a1a19f; --faint:#84847e; --stone:#38372f;
      --ember:#ff6a24; --amber:#d0973f;
      --btn-fill:#e6e5e0; --btn-fill-text:#26251e;
    }
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  body{background:var(--canvas);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;transition:background .35s ease,color .35s ease}
  ::selection{background:#8bc4f8;color:#26251e}

  nav{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .navin{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text)}
  .brand svg{width:22px;height:22px;flex:none}
  .brand span{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em}
  .navend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  nav a.back{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
  nav a.back:hover{color:var(--text)}
  #themeToggle{background:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;width:32px;height:32px;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);
    transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}
  #themeToggle:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--stone)}
  #themeToggle svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  .icon-sun{display:none}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .icon-sun{display:block}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .icon-moon{display:none}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .icon-sun{display:block}
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .icon-moon{display:none}
  }

  main{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px 88px}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,46px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.028em;line-height:1.1;margin-top:14px;max-width:18ch}
  .lead{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;line-height:1.62;color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin-top:20px}
  h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-top:56px}
  p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;font-size:15px;margin-top:12px;max-width:62ch}

  .rate{margin-top:24px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;
    padding:26px 26px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .rate .l{font-size:15px;color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
  .rate .l small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.65;max-width:44ch}
  .rate .v{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:22px;color:var(--text);white-space:nowrap}
  .rate .v span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

  .lines{margin-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
  .line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:26px;padding:20px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);align-items:baseline}
  .line .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .line p{margin-top:0;font-size:15px}
  @media (max-width:640px){.line{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}}

  .tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:22px}
  .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;padding:.45rem .9rem}

  .box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;
    padding:22px 24px;margin-top:44px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}
  .box b{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
  a{color:var(--ember);text-decoration:none}
  a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;
    padding:.7em 1.3em;border-radius:4px;background:var(--btn-fill);color:var(--btn-fill-text);
    margin-top:32px;transition:opacity .15s}
  .btn:hover{opacity:.86;text-decoration:none}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);padding:24px}
  footer a{color:var(--muted)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav><div class="navin">
  <a class="brand" href="/">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="5" y="8" width="30" height="27" rx="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"/>
      <circle cx="15" cy="21" r="3" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="25" cy="21" r="3" fill="currentColor"/>
      <line x1="20" y1="8" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="20" cy="3.5" r="2" fill="currentColor"/>
    </svg><span>NEVARRO</span>
  </a>
  <span class="navend">
    <button id="themeToggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">
      <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
      <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5"/><line x1="12" y1="1.5" x2="12" y2="3.5"/><line x1="12" y1="20.5" x2="12" y2="22.5"/><line x1="4.5" y1="4.5" x2="5.9" y2="5.9"/><line x1="18.1" y1="18.1" x2="19.5" y2="19.5"/><line x1="1.5" y1="12" x2="3.5" y2="12"/><line x1="20.5" y1="12" x2="22.5" y2="12"/><line x1="4.5" y1="19.5" x2="5.9" y2="18.1"/><line x1="18.1" y1="5.9" x2="19.5" y2="4.5"/></svg>
    </button>
    <a class="back" href="/">← Home</a>
  </span>
</div></nav>

<main>
  <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
  <h1>Priced to the work, not to a package.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Every engagement we take on is different in shape, depth, and duration, so we do not publish a menu. What we can tell you plainly is where things start and how they are structured.</p>

  <h2>Consultation</h2>
  <p>For advisory conversations, technical reviews, and scoping sessions — a defined block of time with no obligation beyond it.</p>
  <div class="rate">
    <div class="l">Consultation
      <small>Advisory, technical review, and scoping sessions, held remotely.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="v">from USD 150 <span>/ hour</span></div>
  </div>

  <h2>Growth partnerships</h2>
  <p>Our core work — going inside a company to transform how it operates and scale it toward a strategic outcome. These engagements are long, deep, and structured to the situation, so terms are agreed individually rather than taken off a price list.</p>
  <div class="lines">
    <div class="line">
      <div class="k">Structure</div>
      <p>Terms are written around the outcome we are working toward, and may combine fees, retainers, or other arrangements depending on the engagement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="line">
      <div class="k">Agreement</div>
      <p>Scope, deliverables, targets, and commercials are documented and signed before any work begins. Nothing is billed against an assumption.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="line">
      <div class="k">Currency</div>
      <p>Quoted in USD for international engagements and in INR for domestic ones.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Co-built products</h2>
  <p>Where a partner wants to build a product with us rather than only inside their business, we structure that separately. Our own research interests run broad — productivity, education, and other everyday categories where good software is still surprisingly rare — and a co-built product can start from either side.</p>
  <div class="tags">
    <span class="tag">Productivity</span>
    <span class="tag">Education</span>
    <span class="tag">Industry tools</span>
    <span class="tag">Applied AI</span>
  </div>
  <div class="lines">
    <div class="line">
      <div class="k">Custom builds</div>
      <p>Specialised pricing, quoted in USD against the scope of the product and the depth of the build.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="line">
      <div class="k">Ownership</div>
      <p>How the product is owned, licensed, or shared is settled in writing at the outset — before anything is built.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <b>Payments and taxes.</b> Payments are collected through our payment partners, who may act as merchant of record and appear as the seller on your statement. Applicable taxes are handled as required by the payment partner and by law. Refunds and cancellations are covered in our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
  </div>

  <a class="btn" href="mailto:adi@nevarrotech.com?subject=Pricing%20enquiry">Ask about an engagement</a>
</main>

<footer>© 2026 Nevarro Technologies · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/support">Support</a></footer>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('themeToggle').addEventListener('click',function(){
    var r=document.documentElement,c=r.getAttribute('data-theme');
    if(!c){c=window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light';}
    var n=c==='dark'?'light':'dark';
    r.setAttribute('data-theme',n);localStorage.setItem('nev-theme',n);
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
